# # /olympic-lod/
#
# Permanent identifiers for Olympic LOD: the Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games as
# 5-star Linked Open Data (https://github.com/danedyy/olympic-lod).
#
# https://w3id.org/olympic-lod/ontology       -> the ontology (oly: terms, hash IRIs)
# https://w3id.org/olympic-lod/ontology/1.0.0 -> the ontology as released in v1.0.0
# https://w3id.org/olympic-lod/shapes         -> the SHACL application profile
# https://w3id.org/olympic-lod/scheme/...     -> the code lists, in the dataset
# https://w3id.org/olympic-lod/tokyo2020/...  -> the Tokyo 2020 dataset
# anything else                               -> the project page
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Daniel Samuel Edim
# up202400301@edu.fe.up.pt
# GitHub username: danedyy
#
# Ahmad Imran
# up202403072@edu.fe.up.pt

RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^ontology/1\.0\.0$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danedyy/olympic-lod/v1.0.0/ontology/oly.ttl [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^ontology$ https://danedyy.github.io/olympic-lod/ontology/oly.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^shapes$ https://danedyy.github.io/olympic-lod/shacl/olympic-lod-shapes.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^scheme(/.*)?$ https://danedyy.github.io/olympic-lod/data/rdf/tokyo2020.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^tokyo2020(/.*)?$ https://danedyy.github.io/olympic-lod/data/rdf/tokyo2020.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^ https://danedyy.github.io/olympic-lod/ [R=302,L]
